Which fraction could **not** be placed between the fractions marked on the number line?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=7cm,y=1cm]
\draw[black] (0,0)--(1,0);
\draw[black] (0.25,0)--(0.25,-0.12);
\draw[black] (0.5,0)--(0.5,-0.12);
\node[below,text=black] at (0.25,-0.12) {$\frac{1}{4}$};
\node[below,text=black] at (0.5,-0.12) {$\frac{1}{2}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
